Recover pods after suspended SSH connections

Reset active pod proxy streams and Codex frontends after OpenSSH reports
that their host disconnected. This lets every pod reconnect instead of
retaining silently stalled children, while leaving control-master
detection and cleanup to OpenSSH and the user's SSH configuration.

Enable rumpelpod INFO logs in the generated systemd user service. Log
host and pod connection transitions needed to diagnose future outages.
